# gNewSense Evolution - Domain Registration Guide

This document contains the official network configuration instructions for project maintainers, web developers, and adult server administrators. Because the project founder is under 18, **incoming adult maintainers are responsible for legally registering these web domains and configuring the network layout mapping.**

---

## 🛒 1. Domains to Purchase
Please buy the following two lowercase web domain strings from a trusted registrar (such as Porkbun, Namecheap, or Cloudflare):

1.  **`gnewsenserw.org`** — Main organization cluster domain.
2.  **`gnewsenserw.com`** — Main extension target domain for alternative CPU hardware tracks.

---

## 🌐 2. Subdomain Mapping Index
Once the main domains are purchased, the network team must configure the DNS dashboard panels to map out these exact functional subdomains:

### For `gnewsenserw.org` (Core Infrastructure)
*   **`cdimage.gnewsenserw.org`** ➔ Main ISO storage hosting node for stable core flags.
*   **`spins.gnewsenserw.org`** ➔ Dedicated directory space for specialized Desktop and Window Manager releases.
*   **`torrent.gnewsenserw.org`** ➔ BitTorrent announcer tracker node to manage peer-to-peer file distributions.
*   **`mirrors.gnewsenserw.org`** ➔ Master rsync distribution engine mirror node where external sync clusters pull files.

### For `://gnewsenserw.com` (Alternative Architectures)
*   **`://gnewsenserw.com`** ➔ Hardware cluster endpoint tracking alternative processor architecture images (e.g., Raspberry Pi).

### Historical Aliases (Legacy Intercepts)
*   **`old.gnewsense.org`** ➔ Alias pointer string intended to intercept historical traffic and redirect it cleanly to our SourceForge static pages.

---

## 🛠️ 3. DNS Zone Record Target Blueprints
Web developers must inject these exact parameters into the domain DNS records panel to link our custom names cleanly to our SourceForge static hosting spaces:

```text
;; TYPE    ;; SUBDOMAIN      ;; VALUE / TARGET TARGET
CNAME      www               gnewsenserw.sourceforge.io.
CNAME      cdimage           vhs-mirror.sourceforge.net.
CNAME      spins             vhs-mirror.sourceforge.net.
CNAME      old               gnewsenserw.sourceforge.io.
A          torrent           203.0.113.12
A          mirrors           203.0.113.15
```

---

## 📄 4. A Message to Incoming Maintainers
By registering these domains, you are providing the backbone infrastructure for a project targeting up to 19 desktop environments on a rock-solid Debian Forky base. Ensure all `A` and `CNAME` records remain active and point to our sandboxed build targets.
